WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.680
Everyone, Bonnie made a friend in class...

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.360
no no she literally made a new friend

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.640
I want you to meet... Forky!

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.340
Hi

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.060
Hello

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.560
Ahh!

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.340
he's a spork

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.140
yes, yeah. I know.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.840
Forky is the most important toy to Bonnie right now

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.280
we all have to make sure nothing happens to him

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.440
Woody! We have a situation.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.160
I am not a toy!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.060
I was made for soup, salad, maybe chili

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.440
...and then the trash!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.600
Freedom!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.560
Buzz, we've got to get Forky

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.740
affirmative

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.640
why am I alive?

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.900
You're Bonnie's toy.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.800
you are going to help create happy memories that will last for the rest of her life

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:47.980
huh?

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:48.740
what?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:53.720
Bo?

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:54.940
Forky, come on

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.300
Bo?

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.120
hi there

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:58.620
my name is Gaby Gaby

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.740
we can't stay

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.760
yes you can

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.480
boys

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.240
Woody, behind you

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.640
Bo! What are you doing here?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.780
no time to explain, come with me

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.160
we need to get back to our kid

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.500
ah, Sheriff Woody, always coming to the rescue

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:15.940
Bonnie needs Forky

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:19.920
Woody, who needs a kid's room when you can have all of this

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.600
wow

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.500
Woody

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.200
aren't we going to Bonnie?

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.840
we have to find them

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:27.940
what do we do Buzz?

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:29.060
what would Woody do?

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.360
jump out of a moving vehicle

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.140
Let's go!

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.140
hey, if you gotta go you gotta go

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.060
you know, you've handled this lost toy life better than I could

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.680
open your eyes Woody there's plenty of kids out there

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:45.940
sometimes change can be good

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.340
you can't teach this old toy new tricks

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.920
you'd be surprised

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.560
Bonnie?

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.340
we're going home Forky

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.540
Bonnie, I'm coming!

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:57.880
on my way Woody

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.300
too infinity and beyond!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:03.880
ka boom!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.240
don't let Woody leave

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.400
kids lose their toys everyday

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.780
I was made to help a child

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.620
I don't remember it being this hard

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.220
Woody, somebody's whispering in your ear

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.940
everything's going to be okay

